  "notes": "Create wrench on a crafting table: 3 gold sheets, 1 cogwheel, 1 stick in the 3x3 grid. Pattern GG / GP / ' S' (grid slots 0,1,3 = gold, 4 = cogwheel, 7 = stick). TRUTH: data/create/recipe/crafting/kinetics/wrench.json, key G=#c:plates/gold, P=create:cogwheel, S=#c:rods/wooden, result create:wrench x1.",
